Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.29,0:00:05.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,put on God's whole armor.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.59,0:00:07.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pray it with me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will put on each
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.94,0:00:11.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,piece of the armor,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.51,0:00:13.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,truth, peace, faith,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.17,0:00:14.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,and salvation,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.33,0:00:17.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and pray it over the conversations
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.15,0:00:20.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the work ahead of you today.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.90,0:00:23.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have your shoes beside
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.10,0:00:25.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,the door or breakfast still
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the table.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wherever this morning finds you,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.77,0:00:30.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring the day as it is.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have work to finish,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,someone to care for,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.60,0:00:37.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a difficult conversation ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you can,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.40,0:00:41.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,let your shoulders settle as you listen.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.68,0:00:43.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will pray through
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.26,0:00:45.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,the armor named in Ephesians,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking God to shape our thoughts,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.14,0:00:49.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,words, and actions.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.94,0:00:53.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can join quietly while you prepare.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.46,0:00:53.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:53.87,0:00:56.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,hear where our strength begins.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.30,0:00:58.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Finally, my brethren,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.78,0:01:00.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be strong in the Lord,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.34,0:01:02.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and in the power of his might.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.06,0:01:04.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,thank you for the breath
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,that woke me this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.31,0:01:10.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,I come to you before I know
Dialogue: 4,0:01:10.44,0:01:13.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything this day will require.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.34,0:01:16.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,You see the tasks already arranged
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.09,0:01:17.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the interruptions I
Dialogue: 4,0:01:17.95,0:01:19.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,cannot anticipate.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.70,0:01:22.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some mornings I feel ready;
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.37,0:01:24.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,this morning I bring whatever
Dialogue: 4,0:01:24.60,0:01:26.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,strength I actually have.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.83,0:01:28.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to depend
Dialogue: 4,0:01:28.24,0:01:31.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,on you without hiding my limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me begin with a willing heart
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.66,0:01:36.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of waiting until I feel
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.05,0:01:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,impressive or completely prepared.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my plans before you,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.21,0:01:43.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking for wisdom to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,the good that is mine to do
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.75,0:01:47.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and humility to receive help
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.99,0:01:49.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,along the way.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:50.40,0:01:52.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Put on the whole armour of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:52.62,0:01:54.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may be able to stand
Dialogue: 5,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against the wiles of the devil.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.43,0:01:58.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.78,0:02:00.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,let this prayer reach
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.27,0:02:02.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond these quiet minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.48,0:02:05.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need truth when I answer questions,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:05.39,0:02:08.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,righteousness when nobody is watching,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.38,0:02:10.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,and peace when another
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,person tries my patience.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.38,0:02:14.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need faith when the way
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,ahead is unclear,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:15.66,0:02:18.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,the assurance of your salvation
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.07,0:02:19.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,when shame grows loud,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:19.79,0:02:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your Word when I must choose.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gather these requests
Dialogue: 4,0:02:24.35,0:02:27.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a life that belongs to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:27.21,0:02:29.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from treating prayer as
Dialogue: 4,0:02:29.56,0:02:32.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,a morning task I finish and forget.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let dependence on you accompany
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,my first decision and remain
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.70,0:02:38.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,with me through the last.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.91,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For we wrestle not against
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.91,0:02:43.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}flesh and blood,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but against principalities,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against powers,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against the rulers
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.14,0:02:50.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the darkness of this world,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}against spiritual
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wickedness in high places.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:55.73,0:02:56.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,God of mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.89,0:02:58.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard the way I look
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.68,0:03:00.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,at people today.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.41,0:03:02.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I disagree with someone,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me from reducing that person
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.06,0:03:07.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,to an obstacle or a threat.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.38,0:03:09.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me resist cruelty,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.32,0:03:10.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,deception,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.16,0:03:11.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,and injustice without
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.93,0:03:13.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,cultivating hatred.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.83,0:03:16.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me discernment to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.30,0:03:18.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,harmful behavior and courage
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.47,0:03:21.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,to establish a needed boundary.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.17,0:03:23.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to protect what is good
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.51,0:03:25.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,while remembering the humanity
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,of those involved.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where anger has narrowed my vision,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.14,0:03:32.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,make room for wise counsel,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:32.31,0:03:33.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,fair questions,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.52,0:03:35.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the possibility
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.05,0:03:37.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,that I have more to learn.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.45,0:03:38.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,what standing firm looks
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,like in an ordinary day.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.49,0:03:44.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Wherefore take unto
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}you the whole armour of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that ye may be able
Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.57,0:03:50.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to withstand in the evil day,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and having done all, to stand.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,show me what standing faithfully
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.72,0:04:00.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,looks like in the circumstances
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.11,0:04:01.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,I actually face.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.64,0:04:03.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,It may mean refusing
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.26,0:04:04.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,to repeat a rumor,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:04.72,0:04:06.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,admitting an error,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeping a promise,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,or leaving a conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.73,0:04:11.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,that has become harmful.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.97,0:04:13.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,It may mean doing patient
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,work that nobody will praise.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.47,0:04:18.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Free me from the need to make
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.66,0:04:21.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,every faithful act dramatic.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.08,0:04:22.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,When pressure comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.61,0:04:23.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me remember
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.83,0:04:26.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,what matters before I react.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.27,0:04:27.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the steadiness
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to do what is right,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,even when the result arrives slowly
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.91,0:04:33.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the approval I hoped
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,for never comes.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.14,0:04:37.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Stand therefore,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.32,0:04:40.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}having your loins girt about with truth,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.27,0:04:42.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and having on the breastplate
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.40,0:04:44.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness;
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.25,0:04:45.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.68,0:04:47.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,fasten truth around
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.29,0:04:49.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way I live today.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.37,0:04:51.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my words match what I know,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.65,0:04:53.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give me freedom to say
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I do not know.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I send a message,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.01,0:05:00.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me check whether it is accurate.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I explain myself,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.00,0:05:04.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice where I am
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,tempted to exaggerate.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I surrender the wish
Dialogue: 4,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,to appear more capable,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.55,0:05:10.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,more certain,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.57,0:05:12.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,or more innocent than I am.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.99,0:05:15.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make honesty a place where
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.14,0:05:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can stand securely,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.88,0:05:19.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,without constantly managing
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.11,0:05:21.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,an image or remembering which
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.51,0:05:24.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,version of a story I told.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The night is far spent,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.85,0:05:28.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the day is at hand:
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.72,0:05:30.55,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}let us therefore cast off
Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.55,0:05:32.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the works of darkness,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.16,0:05:33.19,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and let us put
Dialogue: 5,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.23,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}on the armour of light.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.48,0:05:36.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.81,0:05:39.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place before you the habit
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.09,0:05:41.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,that keeps drawing me away
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.21,0:05:43.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,from honesty and love.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.31,0:05:44.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not rename it
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,to make it harmless.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize the moment
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I usually surrender to it:
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.40,0:05:52.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,the idle minute,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.61,0:05:53.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,the injured pride,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.97,0:05:55.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,the private screen,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,the wish to escape discomfort.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.99,0:05:59.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom to change
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.74,0:06:02.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I can change around that moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.73,0:06:05.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me seek appropriate support
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.23,0:06:07.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of relying on secrecy.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this new morning become
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.94,0:06:12.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,an opportunity to turn toward the light
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,through one real and manageable
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.29,0:06:16.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,act of obedience.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.90,0:06:19.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.56,0:06:19.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.91,0:06:21.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,peace for every doorway
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.54,0:06:23.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will walk through today.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.43,0:06:27.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And your feet shod with the preparation
Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.29,0:06:29.32,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the gospel of peace;
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.57,0:06:31.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,prepare my feet to carry peace
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.91,0:06:36.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the places I enter.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.16,0:06:38.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I step into the kitchen,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,the workplace, the classroom,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the waiting room,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:41.79,0:06:44.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice the people already there.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.98,0:06:48.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my arrival make room for kindness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.20,0:06:49.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Slow the sharp greeting
Dialogue: 4,0:06:49.75,0:06:52.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,that comes from feeling rushed.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive when somebody
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.49,0:06:57.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,speaks before I am ready to listen.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.44,0:07:00.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I move between responsibilities,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.12,0:07:02.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me that the person in front
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,of me is more than an interruption.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.72,0:07:08.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me a peaceful presence that can
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.68,0:07:11.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,coexist with necessary urgency.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow a quiet moment here.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.14,0:07:18.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring one person's name before
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,God without planning their
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,entire future.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold that person in prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.69,0:07:25.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask for wisdom about
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.56,0:07:27.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,your own next act of care.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.88,0:07:34.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Above all,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}taking the shield of faith,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.59,0:07:39.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wherewith ye shall be able to quench
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.22,0:07:42.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all the fiery darts of the wicked.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.31,0:07:43.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift the shield of faith
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I face what I cannot
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,settle this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.61,0:07:51.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are answers I would like
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,to have and outcomes I cannot
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,secure by thinking harder.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me trust your character while
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.85,0:08:01.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,doing the work that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.39,0:08:03.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,When an alarming thought arrives,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me room to examine
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.62,0:08:07.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,it before I obey it.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from treating every
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,possibility as a certainty.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let faith steady my attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.40,0:08:17.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,so I can respond to the situation
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.03,0:08:19.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,before me with wisdom rather than
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,surrendering the whole day to
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.97,0:08:23.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,imagined trouble.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.41,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For God hath not given
Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.41,0:08:28.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}us the spirit of fear;
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,but of power, and of love,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.67,0:08:32.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,and of a sound mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.94,0:08:34.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me receive courage
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a thoughtful mind and
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,a loving heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I feel afraid,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:41.01,0:08:42.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me bring that feeling
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.86,0:08:44.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,to you without shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.72,0:08:47.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me toward the information,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.45,0:08:48.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,preparation,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.47,0:08:51.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and support the situation requires.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me read the instructions,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask the useful question,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.81,0:08:58.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,and allow enough time for the journey.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from confusing
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.59,0:09:03.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,confidence with carelessness.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.05,0:09:04.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I need assistance,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me request it plainly.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shape a courage that can
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,admit uncertainty,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.62,0:09:12.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,learn from others,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.02,0:09:13.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,and still take the next
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsible step in your presence.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.77,0:09:19.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, the helmet and the sword,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the thoughts that try
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,to tell you who you are.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.11,0:09:26.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And take the helmet of salvation,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.66,0:09:28.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and the sword of the Spirit,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.83,0:09:31.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which is the word of God:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.36,0:09:32.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.86,0:09:35.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,let the hope of your salvation
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.36,0:09:37.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,guard my mind today.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.32,0:09:39.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before I measure my value
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.36,0:09:40.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,by an achievement,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.84,0:09:41.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,a response,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.74,0:09:44.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,or another person's approval,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.12,0:09:47.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,turn my attention toward your grace.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.36,0:09:50.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you my need for forgiveness
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.24,0:09:52.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my desire to belong.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me live as someone learning
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.96,0:09:57.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive mercy and extend it.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I make a mistake,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.34,0:10:00.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me from calling
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.90,0:10:02.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,the whole day ruined.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.84,0:10:04.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I succeed,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:04.11,0:10:05.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me grateful.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.84,0:10:08.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my identity grow deeper
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.04,0:10:10.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,than the latest evaluation,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:10.23,0:10:11.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,held in the hope
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.53,0:10:13.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have in you.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Praying always with all prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.22,0:10:18.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication in the Spirit,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and watching thereunto with all
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}perseverance and supplication
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.03,0:10:24.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for all saints;
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.75,0:10:26.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.32,0:10:27.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,widen this prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond my own schedule.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.89,0:10:31.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember those who begin
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,today carrying grief,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.69,0:10:35.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,those responsible
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.07,0:10:37.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,for difficult decisions,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,and those whose labor
Dialogue: 4,0:10:38.71,0:10:40.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,is easily overlooked.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.71,0:10:43.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen believers who face hostility,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.90,0:10:46.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,loneliness, or discouragement.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.60,0:10:48.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give wisdom to the people
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.31,0:10:50.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,serving their communities
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.02,0:10:52.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and caring for those in need.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.31,0:10:54.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring trustworthy support
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.30,0:10:56.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,to people who feel isolated.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.84,0:10:58.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me whether I can become
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of an answer through
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,a practical act of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me watchful for needs
Dialogue: 4,0:11:04.36,0:11:06.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,that are close enough for me
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.48,0:11:09.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,to notice and respond to today.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.13,0:11:11.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you go,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,hear the words of courage
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,God spoke to Joshua.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.46,0:11:17.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,They are for you too.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Have not I commanded thee?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.72,0:11:23.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Be strong and of a good courage;
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be not afraid,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.80,0:11:27.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither be thou dismayed:
Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD thy God
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.79,0:11:32.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is with thee whithersoever thou goest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.39,0:11:33.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I hear the words
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.33,0:11:36.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,you spoke to Joshua,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.95,0:11:39.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember that courage grows
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,through trust and obedience.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me in my own
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibilities today.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I may need to make
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,a call I have avoided,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,begin work that feels beyond me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.51,0:11:53.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,or ask for help with a problem
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.89,0:11:55.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot solve alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me prepare carefully and move
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.40,0:12:00.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,without demanding complete
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.34,0:12:01.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,certainty first.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,When the task feels large,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring my attention
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.17,0:12:07.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the first honest step.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.36,0:12:09.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your presence matter more to me
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.73,0:12:12.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,than the appearance of being fearless.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.61,0:12:15.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}It is God that girdeth
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.37,0:12:16.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}me with strength,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.73,0:12:19.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and maketh my way perfect.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.42,0:12:20.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,strengthen me for the work
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is truly mine today.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.90,0:12:27.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me identify what needs attention
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.70,0:12:28.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,first and give it
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,the care it deserves.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am tempted to hurry
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,through something important,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.75,0:12:36.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to slow down
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.25,0:12:38.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,enough to do it well.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:38.06,0:12:39.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am polishing
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.51,0:12:41.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,something unnecessarily,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.34,0:12:44.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me recognize what is sufficient.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.46,0:12:47.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me to take a needed break,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,honor reasonable limits,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.90,0:12:50.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask for help before
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,exhaustion becomes resentment.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my work serve real people,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.81,0:12:58.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and keep my ambition accountable
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.38,0:13:00.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,to love and integrity.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.44,0:13:03.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Fear thou not;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.34,0:13:05.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am with thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be not dismayed;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.46,0:13:09.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am thy God:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:09.73,0:13:11.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will strengthen thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.90,0:13:14.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}yea, I will help thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.10,0:13:14.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}yea,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will uphold thee with the right
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}hand of my righteousness.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.08,0:13:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.40,0:13:23.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive these words as an invitation
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.53,0:13:26.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,to lean on your faithfulness.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize support when
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.54,0:13:31.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,it arrives in ordinary forms:
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.09,0:13:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,wise advice, shared work,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,a patient friend,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the opportunity to ask
Dialogue: 4,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,a clearer question.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.66,0:13:41.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me humility to accept help without
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.70,0:13:44.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,making my need a source of shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.57,0:13:45.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,For the challenge
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.83,0:13:47.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,that still feels heavy,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.52,0:13:49.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide me toward the next
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.29,0:13:51.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,appropriate resource.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you both my hope
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.01,0:13:54.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my uncertainty,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.49,0:13:57.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,trusting that I can speak honestly
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.13,0:14:00.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,while seeking the strength to continue.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.47,0:14:01.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you that I do
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.90,0:14:04.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,not face this day alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose the first doorway you will
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.43,0:14:09.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,enter after this prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.49,0:14:11.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before crossing it,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,pause and pray:
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.52,0:14:15.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, prepare my feet for peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.42,0:14:17.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then greet the first person
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,you meet with deliberate kindness,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,giving them your attention
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.58,0:14:23.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,before making a request.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:23.58,0:14:24.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you are alone,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.99,0:14:27.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,use that same pause before
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.16,0:14:29.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,your first message.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.04,0:14:32.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is your commitment for the morning:
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.16,0:14:34.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,one threshold, one brief prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,one considerate beginning.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.20,0:14:38.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.67,0:14:40.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am ready to begin the next
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of this morning with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:42.89,0:14:44.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let truth guide my answers
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and righteousness shape my
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.94,0:14:48.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,private choices.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.48,0:14:50.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Prepare my feet to bring
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.29,0:14:52.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,peace where I enter.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.09,0:14:53.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen faith when
Dialogue: 4,0:14:53.70,0:14:56.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,uncertainty presses close.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guard my mind with the hope
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,of salvation,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.21,0:15:02.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let your Word direct my conduct.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me prayerful
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and attentive to others.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.81,0:15:07.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I stumble,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,lead me toward repair.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:09.25,0:15:10.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I am weary,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.56,0:15:12.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me receive support.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.83,0:15:14.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you this day
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.37,0:15:15.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,through Jesus Christ,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.99,0:15:19.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,with gratitude for the grace to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:20.31,0:15:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you would like
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,to join this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.20,0:15:24.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can write Amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.99,0:15:26.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also leave a prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.89,0:15:28.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,request in the comments,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.58,0:15:30.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and in our next morning prayer we
Dialogue: 4,0:15:30.91,0:15:33.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,will pray over the requests you share.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:34.88,0:15:36.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you pick up your keys
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.64,0:15:39.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,or return to the room around you,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,carry one part of this prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,into your first action.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:43.14,0:15:45.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give the honest answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.47,0:15:48.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Enter with a peaceful greeting.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:48.14,0:15:50.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ask for help with the responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.83,0:15:52.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,that feels heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.40,0:15:55.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have brought the day before God;
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.26,0:15:58.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,now take the next step with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,May the words of Scripture remain
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.69,0:16:02.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,close as the morning unfolds,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.96,0:16:05.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,guiding your attention back to truth,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,love, and faithful action.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go into your responsibilities
Dialogue: 4,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the hope of Christ beside you.
